### 1. GET all books (Task 2)
### Expected: 200 OK, JSON array with initial books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET books filtered by author and limit (Task 2)
### Expected: 200 OK, 1 item ("Effective Java")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET single book by ID - existing (Task 2)
### Expected: 200 OK, JSON book object
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. GET single book by ID - missing (Task 2)
### Expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/json

### 5. POST create a new book (Task 2)
### Expected: 201 Created + Location: /api/books/{id}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pro Spring 6",
  "author": "Cosmina",
  "year": 2023
}

### 6. PUT replace an existing book (Task 2.2)
### Expected: 200 OK, updated book object
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java (3rd Edition)",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018
}

### 7. DELETE book by ID - first call (Task 2.3)
### Expected: 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### 8. DELETE book by ID - second call on same ID (Task 2.3)
### Expected: 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2


### ===================================================================
### Individual Assignment (Variant 2): GET /api/books/by-year/{year}
### Path variable constrained by regex to 4 digits: {year:\d{4}}
### ===================================================================

### 9. Variant 2: Valid 4-digit year matching books
### Expected: 200 OK, JSON array containing books from 2022
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/2022
Accept: application/json

### 10. Variant 2: Invalid non-4-digit path variable (non-matching regex)
### Expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/by-year/abc
Accept: application/json


### ===================================================================
### Task 4.3: Five HTTP Error Responses Experiment Table
### ===================================================================

### 11. Type mismatch on path variable
### Expected: 400 Bad Request (abc cannot be converted to long id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/abc
Accept: application/json

### 12. Unmapped path
### Expected: 404 Not Found (no HandlerMapping matches /api/nothing)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### 13. Method Not Allowed
### Expected: 405 Method Not Allowed (DELETE not mapped on /api/books collection)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 14. Unsupported Media Type
### Expected: 415 Unsupported Media Type (text/plain not supported by @RequestBody Book)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: text/plain

title=Java&author=Bloch&year=2018

### 15. Not Acceptable representation
### Expected: 406 Not Acceptable (server has no XML message converter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/xml


