### 16. Thymeleaf HTML Page
### Expected: 200 OK, rendered HTML list table
GET http://localhost:8080/books

### 17. Thymeleaf HTML Page with author filter
### Expected: 200 OK, filtered HTML table
GET http://localhost:8080/books?author=Bloch

